cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this computational artifact using these metadata; add the DOI after its release deposit."
type: software
title: "Computational checks for Complete probability logics for neutrosophic triples"
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mleyvaz/neutrosophic-probability-logics-checks"
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducible finite and randomized computational checks for lower-probability
  logics of truth, indeterminacy and falsity. Includes the original numerical
  script, reference results, a runner, and result verification. The checks
  do not replace the formal proofs. Contributor order follows the associated
  research article and does not assert original programmer attribution.
